{"version":1,"key":"card:154","content":{"id":154,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一个元素有可能会被多个选择器选中，并且被应用相同的样式，这种情况我们称之为样式"},{"type":"formatted","text":"层叠","bold":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <title>层叠</title>\n    <style>\n      div {\n        color: green;\n      }\n      .red {\n        color: red;\n      }\n      #box {\n        color: brown;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"red\" id=\"box\" style=\"color: gray\">一段文字</div>\n  </body>\n</html>","language":"html","uuid":"ef852b44-6124-4a6b-98c7-7ff7dac2d69c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述的 div 标签被四个选择器选中，并且同时设置了 color 属性，那么哪个属性会生效呢？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就牵涉到选择器优先级的问题了，优先级大小规则如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"行内样式 > id 选择器 > 类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器 > 标签选择器","language":"css","uuid":"2d588426-405a-4c31-84e8-b51077c95a0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面行内样式会生效，文字颜色显示为 gray 灰色。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面明确了单个选择器优先级的排序，但是对于组合选择器，是多个选择器的组合，它们的优先级又是如何? 它会按照如下顺序进行比较："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"id 选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"标签选择器"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先会比较选择器中 id 选择器的个数，个数多的优先级高，如果个数相同，则继续比较类选择器、伪类选择器、属性选择器这三个选择器个数之和的大小，个数多的优先级高；如果还相同，则继续比较标签选择器的个数，个数多的选择器优先级高。如果比对完个数都相同，那么就看定义的顺序，定义在后面的选择器有高的优先级。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"无论有多少个选择器，行内样式的优先级都比它们高！"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在写样式的时候，我们可能会发现写的样式没有生效，排除拼写错误，很有可能是你的选择器优先级不够，这个时候你可能会在选择器上加上其他选择器，例如 id 选择器来提高它的优先级。那还有一种方法就是在样式的末尾加上 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"!important","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":".container p {\n  color: red;\n}\np {\n  color: blue;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"7cb212f7-57d4-42d1-9942-741089ce4b8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面的选择器的优先级没有上面的高，这时我们可以在样式后添加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"!important","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"p {\n  color: blue !important;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"f3d88da1-fee2-4353-8a14-8b9a28e24a80","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"!important","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以使该条样式无视选择器的优先级，或者说将优先级提升为最高级别，使得被选中的标签使用该样式。"}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"createTime":1690211480204,"updateTime":1743303640405,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640405}}